<title>UK: APV says may get offer for company.</title>
<headline>APV says may get offer for company.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering and components group APV Plc said on Tuesday it had received an &quot;indication of interest&quot; that might result in a bid being made for the company.</p>
<p>&quot;It is not clear at this stage whether this approach will or will not lead to an offer being made for APV,&quot; the firm said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>APV said it would keep shareholders informed of further developments.</p>
<p>APV's shares jumped 5.0p to close at 71. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
